{"title": "Well-Liked and Well-Fortified", "pageid": 28282, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Well-Liked_and_Well-Fortified", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Well-Liked and Well-Fortified</b> is a passive feature that continuously grants temporary hp.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>At the beginning of the wearer's turn, the robe activates, granting them <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">Temporary Hit Points</a> equal to their <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> Modifier. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Temporary_Hit_Points_.28Well-Liked_and_Well-Fortified.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Temporary_Hit_Points_(Well-Liked_and_Well-Fortified)\"> Condition: Temporary Hit Points (Well-Liked and Well-Fortified) </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points_(Well-Liked_and_Well-Fortified)_(Condition)\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points (Well-Liked and Well-Fortified) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Temporary Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points_(Well-Liked_and_Well-Fortified)_(Condition)\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points (Well-Liked and Well-Fortified) (Condition)\">Temporary Hit Points</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Well-Liked and Well-Fortified: instead of dying, you have gained <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a> equal to your Charisma modifier.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potent_Robe\" title=\"Potent Robe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Potent_Robe\" title=\"Potent Robe\">Potent Robe</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The temporary hit points from <b>Well-Liked and Well-Fortified</b> only have a <code>StackPriority</code> of 1, and as such are overridden by any other source of temporary hit points that have a <code>StackPriority</code> of 1 or higher, even if the new source is of a lesser value.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200117\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1218/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13268/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3755/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 754667/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.105      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   41.105      1 -total\n 39.77%   16.346      1 Template:Condition\n 26.42%   10.859      1 Template:Condition_full/format\n 24.87%   10.223      1 Template:Icon_link\n 24.10%    9.907      1 Template:Icon_text\n 23.21%    9.540      9 Template:Trim\n 23.10%    9.494      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 20.68%